            "review_text": "Gordon S\n1 contribution\n0\nBest Thai restaurant in Hanoi by a mile\nDec 2023 • Family\nGetting good Thai food in Hanoi can be a challenge, however Little Thai restaurant in Tayho is absolutely amazing. The food is as good as anything you'll get in Bangkok and the staff are super friendly and helpful. We ordered a few dishes and they were all fantastic, I highly recommend the red curry and chicken satays, the price is also very reasonable.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 22, 2024",
