            "review_title": "Review at Little Thai",
            "review_text": "JSTrip_77\nSarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina1194 contributions\n0\nGREAT New Spot\nJun 2020\nThis immaculate new place on To Ngoc Van offers legitimate Thai food and provides really great customer service. I've been watching the construction and eagerly awaiting the opening of this new place in the neighborhood. And, I was not disappointed one bit. The staff greeted me warmly and gave me a glass of ice-water while I ordered for take away. I would have wanted to eat-in but all of the tables were reserved - something pretty unusual in this part of Tay Ho! But the food came out quickly and correctly. And I have to say that the food was some of the best quality I've had in any of the Thai restaurants, big/small, inexpensive/pricey. It should say a lot that we went to Little Thai for dinner one night and then went back for dinner the following night. It was that good. I had the tom kha gai (the chicken, coconut soup and the Panang moo) both nights...plus pad Thai and a spicy mango salad. All were delicious!\n\nThe restaurant is nicely air conditioned, impeccably clean and welcoming with its new decor. I am not sure if they deliver yet or if they are listed with any of the food delivery services yet. But, this place is absolutely, 100-percent worth repeated visits!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 22, 2020",
